===Ask Clara about the weird occurrence in the camp{{subst:void|<!--201090902-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=Robot Settlement|update|Clara sent a message claiming another weird occurrence happened in the camp. Would this have anything to do with Pascal?}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Clara)
:'''Clara:''' Oh, it's you! I wanted to show you something... These little fellas.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What about them?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That big one in the middle &mdash; is that...
::'''Clara:''' Yes... he's Pascal.
:'''Automaton Grizzly:''' Hello, hello, hello! Long time no see!
:'''Automaton A:''' Long time no see! Today, weather, great!
:'''Automaton B:''' Thank, you! Long time, no see! (Trailblazer) friend, Clara friend!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} They know who I am?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} But I don't know them...
:'''Clara:''' Yes, that's what I was talking about... Something strange has happened.
:'''Clara:''' Mr. Svarog helped to format Pascal and integrate him into the base network, but after that...
:'''Clara:''' ...I discovered that whenever I mentioned your name to Mr. Svarog, these guys at the base would get really happy.
:'''Clara:''' Look how excited they are about you! I've never met anyone for the first time that was so happy to see me...
:'''Clara:''' I was wondering... is it because they share Pascal's emotions?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} If so, that'd be fantastic.
::'''Clara:''' Yeah, it's like Pascal is always with us.
::'''Clara:''' It's a nice feeling... just like the one I had before.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Maybe it's some kind of technical fault?
::'''Clara:''' That's what Mr. Svarog said. He said Pascal's emotional intelligence was like a virus that infected the entire base network at some point.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} A virus...
::'''Clara:''' Don't worry, {{MC|ж=big sister|м=big brother}}. I don't think it's a bad thing, because...
::'''Clara:''' ...Mr. Svarog chose not to get rid of it. Isn't that the most convincing proof?
{{Dialogue End}}

